To run the code the first thing to do is open "SQUARE/CITIES" and run the code by writing in terminal

1. make 

2. ./simulator.exe

The purpose of this code is to create the different cities once, in order to not risk creating different cities for different MPI processes. 

Now if you want to run the parallelized code go in "SQUARE/SOURCE" and write the following commands:

1. make
2. mpiexec -np 'number of processes' ./simulatore 




